<article class="env-definition" id="0EE2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EE2">Definition <span data-tag="0EE2">82.4.2</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme and let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. Let $x \in |X|$. Let $d \in \{ 0, 1, 2, \ldots , \infty \} $. We say <em>$\mathcal{F}$ has length $d$ at $x$</em> if the equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/0EE1" data-tag="0EE1">82.4.1</a> are satisfied. </p>
</article>